    <string name="preset_music_sprinkler">Musical sprinkler truck</string>
    <string name="preset_music_sprinkler_summary">Loop the opening phrase of Lan Hua Cao while cruising with blue water lights, then park. Keep 2 m clear ahead; no firing.</string>
    <string name="preset_space_launch">Space launch</string>
    <string name="preset_space_launch_summary">A red countdown, orange ignition, blue cruise and a starry orbital finale; lights and sound only.</string>
    <string name="preset_firefly_garden">Firefly garden</string>
    <string name="preset_firefly_garden_summary">Dusk fades into answering fireflies, soft notes and a gentle nightfall; no movement.</string>
    <string name="preset_lucky_cat">Lucky cat</string>
    <string name="preset_lucky_cat_summary">Center the gimbal, greet visitors left and right, nod and ring a golden welcome; chassis stays still.</string>
    <string name="preset_moonlight_waltz">Moonlight waltz</string>
    <string name="preset_moonlight_waltz_summary">Two three-beat phrases with side steps and gentle turns under violet light. Keep 1 m clear around the robot.</string>
    <string name="preset_station_train">Little sightseeing train</string>
    <string name="preset_station_train_summary">Depart with a bell, visit forest, seaside, stars and home along four short legs. Keep 1 m clear around the robot.</string>
    <string name="preset_battery_mood_show">Robot wakes up</string>
    <string name="preset_battery_mood_show_summary">Wake from a dim yawn, check the battery mood and play a morning tune, or return to sleep if tired; no movement.</string>
    <string name="preset_street_chef">Midnight street chef</string>
    <string name="preset_street_chef_summary">Warm the griddle, chop in rhythm, flash through a sizzling stir-fry and ring the serving bell; no movement.</string>
    <string name="preset_penalty_keeper">Penalty keeper</string>
    <string name="preset_penalty_keeper_summary">Make two sideways saves: recover from a wrong guess, then celebrate a clean save. Keep 1 m clear on each side.</string>
    <string name="preset_traffic_officer">Traffic officer</string>
    <string name="preset_traffic_officer_summary">Wait at red, check both sides with the gimbal, open the green light and close with amber; chassis stays still.</string>
    <string name="preset_bomb_squad">Bomb squad</string>
    <string name="preset_bomb_squad_summary">Ticks and red flashes accelerate, then a last-second silence gives way to a green all-clear; lights and sound only.</string>
    <string name="preset_friday_disco">Friday night party</string>
    <string name="preset_friday_disco_summary">Tribute to Beck Martin\'s legendary \'Friday Night\' audition on The X Factor: smoke machine blasts, gym instructor groove, side shuffles, sky pointing, and a 360 spin as judges dance along. Keep 1.5 m clear around the robot.</string>
